<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Taiwan Weighted Index.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Taiwan Weighted Index.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wednesday it was issuing three tranches of American-style call warrants on Taiwan's Weighted Index.</p>
<p> EXERCISE RATIO   10 warrants control one underlying</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 Dec 30, 1997</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   US$306.71</p>
<p> ISSUE SIZE	 Tranche A: 3.0 million warrants</p>
<p>			Tranche B: 3.0 million warrants</p>
<p>			Tranche C: 3.0 million warrants</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     Tranche A: US$276.04</p>
<p>			Tranche B: US$306.71</p>
<p>			Tranche C: US$337.38</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	Tranche A: US$4.43 (per warrant)</p>
<p>			Tranche B: US$2.75 (per warrant)</p>
<p>			Tranche C: US$1.63 (per warrant)</p>
<p> PREMIUM	    Tranche A: 4.45 percent</p>
<p>			Tranche B: 8.98 percent</p>
<p>			Tranche C: 15.3 percent</p>
<p> GEARING	    Tranche A: 6.9X</p>
<p>			Tranche B: 11.13X</p>
<p>			Tranche C: 18.87X</p>
<p> LISTING	    Luxembourg</p>
<p> PAYDATE	    April 7, 1997</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW    French</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
